L1: Effects of Plyometric Training and Beta-Alanine Supplementation on Maximal-Intensity Exercise and Endurance in Female Soccer Players
L2: Journal of Human Kinetics (2017)
L3: Fabián Rosas, Rodrigo Ramírez-Campillo, Cristian Martínez, Alexis Caniuqueo, Rodrigo Cañas-Jamet, Emma McCrudden, Cesar Meylan, Jason Moran, Fábio Y. Nakamura, Lucas A. Pereira, Irineu Loturco, Daniela Diaz, Mikel Izquierdo
L4: 1 Rosas of Buenos Aires Sport Club ,  Buenos Aires ,  Argentina
L5: 2 Department of Physical Activity Sciences, Research Nucleus in Health ,  Physical Activity and Sport ,  Universidad de Los Lagos ,  Osorno ,  Chile
L6: 3 Laboratory of Exercise Sciences ,  MEDS Clinic ,  Santiago ,  Chile
L7: 4 Department of Physical Education ,  Sport and Recreation ,  Universidad de La Frontera ,  Temuco ,  Chile
L8: 5 Laboratory of Physiology and Biomechanics ,  Universidad Autónoma de Chile ,  Temuco ,  Chile
